{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Create and fund a support system for dog attack victims",
        "additional_details": "The Government should create and fund a national support system offering guidance, therapy and recovery so no child, adult or family is left to cope alone.",
        "background": "Those attacked by dogs can be left with fear, nightmares and lasting trauma. Families can face huge gaps in care following dog attacks. We need a national trauma support service so victims aren\u2019t left alone.",
